    "detailed_description": "Days Gone By tries to endevour a striking expierence getting back that simpleton feeling of the long gone scrolling genre.<br />\r\nProviding a mesh up of levels where timing and awareness are essential for completing the game levels, it tries to strike every kind of Player.<br />\r\nNo respawn, no second chance, no power-ups, no buff and no maps to help you it's a one way journey to a tale told many times and never truly forgotten.<br />\r\nA dozen of levels to face and beat and you will take on a magic king to arrival.<br />\r\nAND NOW A FRACKING HUGE SWORD! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAvailable on Windows PC, Macs, Linux based platforms and SteamOS machines.<br />\r\nPurchasing the game gives you access no matter which the aforementioned system you are using.<br />\r\nBuy the package and you can play wherever you are!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy!",
